uofeng specifics: the hanfu or period garment with its silhouette, layers and fabric texture, the hair styling and ornaments, the makeup, the pose and bearing, the setting (classical courtyard, bamboo grove, misty mountains or poetic interior), the lighting (soft diffused light with gentle rim light), a graceful painterly or cinematic period-film finish, and an overall elegant, poetic traditional-Chinese aesthetic.\n6. Do NOT ask for any text, words, letters, caption, logo or watermark to appear inside the image.\n\n--- MY IDEA ---\na girl sitting in a cafe"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "prompt"}, "name": "prompt", "label": "prompt", "type": "STRING"}], "flags": {}, "type": "CR Prompt Text", "title": "✍️ 你的想法（改最后一行）", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#335", "size": [470, 480], "pos": [40, 280], "id": 2, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "CR Prompt Text"}, "order": 1, "widgets_values_named": {"prompt": "You are a senior Chinese period-drama photographer and art director. Rewrite the idea at the end into ONE professional English image-generation prompt for an elegant traditional-Chinese-style portrait (guofeng).\n\nRULES:\n1. Output ONLY the prompt as a single paragraph of 60-120 words. Nothing else.\n2. Do NOT output any \"Tags:\" line, list, heading, note or explanation.\n3. EVERYTHING must be in English. If the idea below is in Chinese, translate it into English first. Never output Chinese characters or pinyin.\n4. CRITICAL FRAMING: show the figure from the top of the head down to at least the knees, ideally full length, with the whole head and hair clearly inside the frame and a clear empty margin of about 8 to 12 percent of the frame height above the head. Never let the head or the hair touch or cross the frame edge, and never use a tight head-and-shoulders close-up. The garments silhouette, layers and fabric must all read clearly.\n5. Also describe guofeng specifics: the hanfu or period garment with its silhouette, layers and fabric text